{{Classic Era}}__NOTOC__

The Tutorial Zone is the starter area for all new characters in Norrath. It has a bank, a limited merchant, and a cave area (not to be confused with the Mines of Gloomingdeep, which is a tutorial zone in other eras/servers). The most important thing you can do here is complete the initial quests for some XP and obtain the [[Boots of the Long Road]], which have a clicky speed buff. Consider obtaining 3 of the boots, one for your feet slot, and one for each "any" slot. You will gain the HP and AC boosts from each of them.

