== Safe/Evac Spot ==
N/A

== Dangers ==

This zone is the starter zone for a reason: it's very safe. Nothing will aggro on you here, regardless of race, class, or deity choice.

== Benefits ==

Get those boots!

== Popular Camps ==

'''Cemetery:'''
There is only one place to really "camp" here, and that's the cemetery. You can kill skeletons here to your heart's content, turning in their skulls for boots, and merging those boots until you grow bored.

== Traveling To and From the Tutorial Zone==

You can only enter the tutorial zone with new character. Once you leave the tutorial zone, there is no going back.

